            "text": "At Woof Loof, Cavapoos are our best-selling breed because they adapt well to Singapore\u2019s lifestyle. Their compact size, friendly temperament, and low-shedding coats make them an excellent choice for families, couples, and first-time dog owners looking for a loving lifelong companion.",
